          <p class="rf-p">To start a return, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@imosaicart.com" class="rf-link">info@imosaicart.com</a>. Returns should be sent to:</p>
          <div class="rf-note">28 Liberty St, New York, NY 10005, United States</div>
          <p class="rf-p">If your return is accepted, we'll send you a return shipping label plus instructions on how and where to send your package. <strong>Items sent back without first requesting a return will not be accepted.</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div id="rf-fees" class="rf-sec">
          <h2 class="rf-h2">Return Fees</h2>
          <div class="rf-fees">
            <div class="rf-fee">
              <div class="rf-fee__head"><span class="rf-fee__ic rf-fee__ic--ok"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span><span class="rf-fee__t">Defective Products</span></div>
