          <p class="rf-p">We'll notify you once we've received and inspected your return, and let you know if the refund was approved. If approved, you'll be automatically refunded to your original payment method within <strong>10 business days</strong>. Please remember it can take additional time for your bank or credit card company to process and post the refund.</p>
